    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Paulo yeekalirisa abaali mu lwekobaano yaakoba ati: “Aboluganda, okutuukiza irala buti mpulira ng'omwoyo gwange ghazira kye gunvunaana ku ngeri ye neebisiisaamu mu maiso ga Katonda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukulu wa Bakabona Anania yalagira abo abaali okumpi ni Paulo okumukuba omunwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo yaakoba ati: “Iwe ekisenge ekyabbaakibwa erangi endheru, Katonda alikukuba. Otyaime okunsalira omusango ng'Amateeka bwe gakoba, kabiri waalagira okunkuba Amateeka kye gatakoba!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.27+MAT.23.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 23:27-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo abaali beemereire okumpi ni Paulo baamukoba bati: “Oli kuvuma Omukulu wa Bakabona owa Katonda!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo yairamu ati: “Baganda bange, mbaire timanhie nga n'Omukulu wa Bakabona, kuba kyaghandiikibwa kiti, ‘Toyogeranga bubi ku mukulu wa ighanga lyo.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.22.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 22:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo bwe yamanha ng'abali mu lwekobaano abandi Basaddukaayo ate ng'abandi Bafarisaayo, yaayogerera ghaigulu ati: “Baganda bange, nze ndi Mufarisaayo, omwana ow'Abafarisaayo. Ndi ghano ku musango olw'eisuubi lye ndi nalyo mu kuzuukira kw'abafu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bik 26:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Fil 3:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yakoba atyo, ghaidhagho okusoola ghagati w'Abafarisaayo n'Abasaddukaayo era olwekobaano lwekutulamu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba Abasaddukaayo bakoba bati ezira kuzuukira, ezira bamalaika waire emizimu. Aye Abafarisaayo baikiririza mu ebyo byonsatuli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.22.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 22:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.12.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 12:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.20.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 20:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaabaagho okukaabuka kunene era abandi ku Banamateeka ab'omu kikunsu eky'Abafarisaayo, baayemerera, baatakana n'amaani baakoba bati: “Titubona kibi ku muntu ono. Tomanha omwoyo oba malaika bw'aba ng'ayogeire naye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okusoola bwe kweyongera okuba okw'amaani, omukulu ow'abaisirukale yaatya ati Paulo baidha kumukutulamu. Agho ni n'okulagira abaisirukale baje batooleyo Paulo mu bantu lwa maani, bamutwale mu nkambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu bwire obwairirira, Musengwa yaayemerera aghaali Paulo yaamukoba ati: “Guma omwoyo, kuba nga bwe waammanhisa mu Yerusalemu, era otyo bw'oteekwa okuumanhisa ni mu Roma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe bwakya enkyo, Abayudaaya beekobaana, beefuugha nga bakoba bati tibaja kulya waire okunhwa okutoolaku nga bamaze okwita Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeekobaana batyo baali baswika abantu amakumi ana (40). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho baaja ye Bakabona Abakulu n'abakulu ab'ebika, baakoba bati: “Twesoomeire obutakomba ku kantu koonakoona okutoolaku nga tumaze okwita Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mperaano imwe n'olwekobaano, mutume y'omukulu ow'abaisirukale amubaleetere nga mwefuula ng'abenda okwongera okwetegereza ebimugemaku. Ife tumaliriire okumwita ng'akaali kubatuukaku.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye mutabane wa mwanhina Paulo, yaiguka mu lukwe lwaibwe, yaaja mu nkambi yaakobera Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo yaayeta owundi ku bakulu ab'ebikunsu eby'abaisirukale yaamukoba ati: “Twala omwisuka ono y'omukulu ow'abaisirukale, ali ni ky'ayenda okumukobera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamutwala yaamutuusa y'omukulu ow'abaisirukale, yaakoba ati: “Omusibe Paulo andhese, yansaba ndeete omwisuka ono y'oli mbu ali ni ky'ayenda okukukoba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukulu ow'abaisirukale yaagema omwisuka ku mukono, yaamwiza ku mbali yaamubuuza ati: “Kiki ekyo ky'oyenda okunkoba?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwisuka yairamu ati: “Abayudaaya baisainia okukusaba otwale Paulo mu lwekobaano enkyo nga beefuula ng'abenda okwongera okwetegereza ebimugemaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye otaganha, kuba ghaligho abasaadha abasinga mu makumi ana (40) abaja okumweteega. Beesoomeire obutalya waire okunhwa okutoolaku nga bamaze okumwita era mperaano beetegeike nga bateeze ky'onaabakoba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
